<translate>
==== BadInMicrowave ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
If the parameter is set to true, then microwave cooking will add unhappiness and boredom to the food.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
BadInMicrowave = true,
</syntaxhighlight>
